          =-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
          |             Corporation Menu               |
          =-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-

            [E] Exchange with Corp Members (This sector only)
            [F] Find Corp Members
            [J] Join a Corporation 
            [K] Kick out a Member of your Corporation (CEO only)
            [L] List Corporations
            [R] Rank Corporations		  
            [P] Change password (CEO only)		   
            [S] Start a Corporation
            [T] Take over your Corporation (Only when CEO has quit)
            [V] View a Corporation 
            [X] Leave your Corporation 
            [Q] Main Menu 

